The property is **`functions`**. You add glob patterns as keys under it and set **`maxDuration`** (in seconds) for each pattern:

```json
{
  "functions": {
    "api/*.js": { "maxDuration": 30 }
  }
}
```

Source: Vercel's vercel.json reference (vercel.com/docs/project-configuration/vercel-json), fo

You use the **`functions`** property. Inside it, each key is a glob pattern that matches function files, and you set **`maxDuration`** (in seconds) on that entry:

```json
{
  "functions": {
    "api/*.js": { "maxDuration": 30 }
  }
}
```

Source: https://vercel.com/docs/project-configuration/vercel
